@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@jobPostId = cmvdxmld80017akun1kaxw0p7
@page = 1
@limit = 10

### First upload a PDF using cvs.http, then apply (login as an APPLICANT in auth.http)
# @name createApplication
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobPostId": "{{jobPostId}}"
}

### Use the returned application ID in this file
# @applicationId = {{createApplication.response.body.$.application.id}}
@applicationId = {{createApplication.response.body.$.application.id}}

### Applicant: list my applications (page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/me?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### Applicant: list my applications (page 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/me?page=2&limit={{limit}}

### Applicant: filter my applied applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/me?status=APPLIED&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### Applicant: see applications whose CV scoring is complete
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/me?scoreStatus=COMPLETED&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### Applicant, HR, or ADMIN: get one application and its scores
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}

### HR or ADMIN: list applications with optional filters and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications?jobPostId={{jobPostId}}&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### HR or ADMIN: filter applications whose CV scoring has completed
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications?jobPostId={{jobPostId}}&scoreStatus=COMPLETED&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### HR or ADMIN: search applicants and filter by score range
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications?search=matthew&minScore=60&maxScore=90&page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}

### HR or ADMIN: update application status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHORTLISTED"
}

### Retry scoring after scoreStatus is FAILED (applicant owner, HR, or ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/retry-scoring
